    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape and survive in this supernatural puzzle adventure game where light is your only defense!</strong><br><br>Play as a female protagonist that is visiting her grandmother's house where you explore eerie locations, solve escape room-style puzzles, and uncover hidden objects while managing your sanity.  Navigate between reality and a twisted ghost dimension while you fend off spirits with your flashlight and unravel the dark history of a cursed town.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore The Witch's Realm</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate eerie locations, each hiding secrets and deadly threats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunted House</strong> \u2013 The last refuge of a good witch\u2026 and now a dangerous trap.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Abandoned Town</strong> \u2013 Shrouded in mystery, filled with remnants of a lost past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Foggy Graveyard</strong> \u2013 Where restless spirits linger, guarding hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Twisted Swamp</strong> \u2013 A dark, shifting maze that distorts reality itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Classic Escape Room-Style Puzzles</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number codes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riddle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Managing Your Sanity</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in the darkness, the lower your sanity gets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use\u00a0<strong>Safe Zones to increase your sanity\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lower your sanity, the more frequent and aggressive ghostly encounters become</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Flashlight Mechanic</u></strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your defense against the darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shining it on ghosts will temporarily make them flee or stun them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Ghost Dimension</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alternate dimension filled with supernatural power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleanse alters &amp; ritual sites where ghosts use to cross over to the main world\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the truth and escape <strong>The Witch\u2019s Realm</strong>\u2014or will you become its next lost soul?</p>",
